# the UI framework (every primitive draws its borders through it).
Core\Core_Pixel.lua
Core\Core_Services.lua
Core\Core_Encounter.lua
# Each game version's raids: which kill ends one (clear timer, raid summary)
Core\Core_FlavorRaids.lua
# "A newer ZacUI is out": versions compared with the guild and group.
Core\Core_VersionCheck.lua
# Finish pass (2026-11-07): one login popup at a time (ns.Popups) - the
# import offer, the look picker, the welcome, what's new, stale parts.
# Before every file that puts one up; makes nothing at load.
Core\Core_Popups.lua
# Fresh install / after Reset ZacUI: ZacUI's bars and unit frames start
# where Blizzard's were (the parts call it; makes nothing at load).
Core\Core_FreshLayout.lua

