# Bindings.xml (key names for bars 2 and 7-10, used by Zacui_Bars) is NOT
# listed here: the client picks a Bindings.xml up from the addon folder by
# itself, and one loaded as an ordinary UI file only produces "Unrecognized
# XML" warnings. It stays in THIS folder: the client expects it where it
# first found it and warns "Couldn't open Zacui/Bindings.xml" otherwise.
